    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "LAM",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/118209638212606376297/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXx-OfNaXFk2qxgXo3eTSpm8llhs_JfanVwd_VVseF2GLIWaA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "Joumana is fantastic! I chose the duo package; Pearl’s Dream body massage and the New Face massage. Both massages were truly wonderful. I instantly felt comfortable walking into her little oasis, and I came out relaxed,  rejuvenated, and glowing. Joumana is lovely, welcoming, and has just the right touch for someone needing some TLC. I can’t wait until my next visit. See you soon◡̈",
        "time": 1736544272,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Marta WR",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/106326215965130777168/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjV-MBGpjn5y22b6A1KKgEWgNANP63QWMzQjmWiQhKohGkRh-gh34A=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "My experience with Joumana was amazing. I had 90 minute body massage and a lift face massage. I felt relaxed and rejuvenated. The massage was great, my faces looked so glowy and contoured. I could visibly tell that the lymphatic draining was working. The studio is very pleasant, clean and tastefully done. Joumana is very nice, warm person and made me feel very welcomed and pampered. I am looking forward to my next visit :) great experience.",
        "time": 1732288394,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Daniela",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/114720125852209949669/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKJ9D-e_ZFH35C8u--Den4ApiiMbUU2GDQGI7gydgrpBgD5cA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "8 months ago",
        "text": "Joumana is incredible! I suffer from migraines that are also linked to tension in my jaw, and I've tried so many different treatments with little relief. I decided to try a release facial massage, and wow—I literally felt the tension melt away. It was amazing! If you suffer from migraines, I highly recommend trying the release. It made such a difference for me!",
        "time": 1748632735,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Kassia Y.",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/113428274551672556209/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjULYXYYBFt9r7NtPPse2p2V_s9gC9Hn5K8Gsj78HMOQPvOYq6c=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "I have gone to Joumana for a full body massage twice, and both times have been incredible experiences. Everything from the space to her presence was calming. Her hands were strong and she paid close attention to the areas I needed work in. She finished the session with a warm towel to remove the excess oil, which was such a nice little bonus! She also poured me a glass of water at the start and end of the session, which I found very thoughtful. She was very respectful throughout the session and would remain silent for the most part, or whisper when she needed to ask me a question. This further allowed me to fully relax. This is a biggie for me as I have stopped returning back to previous MTs who had good technique, but who would talk to me the entire session which I really dislike. Overall, 5 star experience that I would recommend to all women who need to hit their reset button! Thank you Joumana for loving what you do and for helping women feel good ❤️.",
        "time": 1725028683,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Priya",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/112143523080333877405/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUioqKh-DFKDDrZdIT9dzqNw1xwloJJvcga-2CbE1eVqAWPcQgmiw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "12 months ago",
        "text": "I highly recommend Joumana for a truly amazing experience! It was my first time getting a facial massage, and I’m already planning my next one. Joumana is incredibly talented, and the peaceful ambiance she has created only adds to the relaxation. I’m so glad I found her here in Vaudreuil!",
        "time": 1740196362,
        "translated": false
      }
